OL,3,GNEWSALast Christmas wish inspires
OL,4,Ahospice appeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 22-year-old hospice patient who
OL,7,Fcelebrated Christmas in May weeks
OL,8,Fbefore her death has inspired a festive
OL,9,Fappeal at the site which cared for her.
OL,11,FMadi Foster from Stafford fought
OL,12,Fadrenocortical carcinoma for three
OL,13,Fyears, raising thousands of pounds for
OL,14,Flife-lengthening treatment abroad.
OL,16,FShe spent her final weeks in Katharine
OL,17,FHouse Hospice, where staff in May
OL,18,Fhelped her decorate her room, cooked a
OL,19,FChristmas dinner, and dressed up to
OL,20,Fjoin her family and friends in festive
OL,21,Fgames.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
