OL,3,GNEWSALast Christmas wish inspires
OL,4,Ahospice appeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs the hospice launched its Care this
OL,7,FChristmas appeal to raise money for
OL,8,Fvital services, Foster's Dad Craig said
OL,9,Fthe "fantastic" team there had helped
OL,10,Fgrant his daughter's "last wish".
